OL,3,GNEWSAKing arrives at AI summit in
OL,4,AAyrshire where he will urge tech bosses
OL,5,Ato protect humanity
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn a busy day for the royals, the
OL,8,FPrince and Princess of Wales will be
OL,9,Fout and about on the Isle of Bute,
OL,10,Fwhile the Duke of Sussex is expected to
OL,11,Fattend an Invictus Games event in
OL,12,FLondon
OL,14,FIt'll be the first time all four have
OL,15,Fappeared in public since Prince Harry
OL,16,Fand Meghan returned to the UK - the
OL,17,FSussexes remain non-working royals
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a row has erupted between
OL,20,FBuckingham Palace and Earl Spencer,
OL,21,FPrincess Diana's brother, over claims
OL,22,Fhe makes about the King in a new memoir
